<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Frontier cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Frontier cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it downgraded Frontier Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- On Tuesday, Frontier said its fourth quarter earnings from recurring operations would be in a $0.30 to $0.34 per share range. The company earned $0.36 per share in last year's fourth quarter.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/8 to 20-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
